  "status": "SOURCE_IMPLEMENTED_NOT_COMPILED_OR_EXECUTED",
  "authority": "Typed-source inspection and implementation only. No fresh native queries or runtime evidence.",
  "production_dependency": "require_loader_attach_runtime: actual native Worker.configure body and a Graph-admissible original application lifecycle.",
  "findings": [
    "Previous SourceOwned Policy validation was not propagated to Graph::create, which still required four callbacks unconditionally. This prevented that profile from reaching the actual Graph/Worker route."
  ],
  "implementation": [
    "Graph and Policy now share lifecycle_configuration_valid, preserving Explicit and cooperative SourceOwned rules while admitting the deliberately selected OriginalApplication profile.",
    "OriginalApplication uses actual own/null completion routing, Application reap/worker-return and Policy context finish. It requires no opaque unload callback or mandatory Stop and rejects a mixed external/source-stop proof. Local retirement still requires returned exact graph, open/nonpoisoned IO, zero tracked loans/allocations/active calls, sessions/jobs, and scheduler work/queue; subsequent real Profile/Graph/Runtime close routes remain.",
    "select_original_worker_lifecycle selects the actual source profile without installing empty callback functions. Optional after/returned observers remain possible; local source retirement is not a foreign/image unload claim.",
    "configure_native_worker constructs real NativeAcceptor/Iocp/Gate/Dispatcher/AsyncAccept/SocketFactory/RetryCancel plus recovered executor in local Inputs, rechecks empty destinations, then commits actual owners/stream/version/profile. Target inputs remain untouched on construction failure. No SDK resource creation, WSAStartup, wait or worker start occurs in this configure body."
  ],
  "scenarios_added": "Existing Policy/Profile fixture exercises OriginalApplication without Stop/external proof, retained actual IO/work false and local retirement true. Existing real own-pipe Graph/Worker/Runtime fixture gains OriginalApplication with zero external callback calls. Native configure source case checks actual paired SDK/executor owners, stream/version, preserved LastError and replacement rejection. Not compiled/executed.",
  "scope_limits": [
    "OriginalApplication is a selected typed source profile, not a claim of whole native ABI/concurrency/AcceptEx/loader equivalence.",
    "configure_native_worker still must be bound by a real per-image owner to Worker.settings.configure with real stream and explicit version.",
    "require_loader_attach_runtime remains undefined; detach remains source-defined and uncompiled.",
    "Real Domain/configuration/host/Online/log/error/image assembly and complete synchronous attach remain required."
  ],
